---
/**
 * Projects body. Shared by the standalone /projects page and the home
 * page's desktop side panel, so the two never drift apart.
 */
---
<div class="projects">
  <p class="projects-intro">Here are some of the projects I've worked on:</p>

  <article class="project">
    <h2>Sphere Smackdown: Brawl of the Balls</h2>
    <video class="project-video" src="/video/sphere-smackdown.mp4" controls playsinline muted loop preload="metadata"></video>
    <details class="project-details">
      <summary>About the project</summary>
      <p>
        A game I built with a close friend, Emily Bosa, to learn the ins
        and outs of 2D collisions and physics in the Unity engine. It also
        meant real practice with Unity's version control &mdash; a hassle
        in the moment, but worth learning.
      </p>
    </details>
  </article>
</div>

<style>
  .projects {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  .projects-intro {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .project {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 32rem;
  }
  .project h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .project-video {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
  }
  .project-details {
    width: 100%;
  }
  .project-details summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .project-details p {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
    color: #555;
  }
</style>
